# AurumOS - Deep Learning APT Packages
# Note: Python packages are in pip-requirements.txt (installed via uv)
# Note: CUDA/cuDNN/TensorRT require NVIDIA developer repo (added by build.sh)

# --- GPU Runtimes (NVIDIA repo) ---
# CUDA 12.8 is the FLOOR for Blackwell (RTX 50-series, sm_120). 12.6 predates
# Blackwell and yields "no kernel image available" on those GPUs.
cuda-toolkit-12-8
libcudnn9-cuda-12
libcudnn9-dev-cuda-12
libnccl2
libnccl-dev
tensorrt
tensorrt-dev
# Blackwell needs an R570+ driver. The debootstrap Ubuntu base ships no NVIDIA
# driver, so pull the CUDA-repo metapackage (installs the matching driver).
# NOTE: driver install on a live ISO needs real-hardware validation (DKMS +
# initramfs); verified to apt-resolve, not yet boot-tested on a Blackwell card.
cuda-drivers

# --- GPU Monitoring ---
nvtop
gpustat

# --- Container Runtime (rootless DL) ---
podman
podman-docker
nvidia-container-toolkit
